{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Verify-parity sweep evidence, Nov 20 2026. The same 5 s x 3 HEAD-probe TimeoutExpired errors (git -C <worktree> rev-parse HEAD timed out after 5 seconds, from the autouse _no_repo_commits guard) appear as ERRORs in all 5 sandboxed overnight make verify logs of Nov 19-20, which overlapped about 8 concurrent -n 4 suites. They appear in none of the 5 complete slot-capped unsandboxed runs of Nov 20 (load ~30). Probe latency measured today at load ~25: git rev-parse HEAD 15 ms inside and outside the sandbox. The observed trigger is host oversubscription beyond the 3-run verify-slot cap; not worked by the sweep."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795207277500224001,"uuid":"fb97ad64-7ac8-4c6d-baa4-55c5bdaa5633"}